        <p>[From tio Darwen. Neuv.]</p>
        <p>Mrs. RosANNA DARDIS is twenty-eight years of age and resides at 35, Nelson-street, Damen, with her husband and two children. " I must first of all tell you," said Mrs. Dardis to a re- porter ol the DarwenNews, that several members of our family have died of consumption. My mother. a brother, aud a sister, were all taken off by that disease, the last to die being my sister, who died a little over two years ago. Dir- 2ctly after my sister's leath my trn seem- to have Ime. Gra- tally my 5 steady</p>
