        <p>passed all cure, but my husband urged me to buy some, and give them a fair trial. I therefore bcught a bor. The effect was extraordinary. I told my husband I be- lieved I was getting better, but be could hardly credit it. I continued using the pills, recovered my health like ruagic, and you cannot, unless von have been afflicted as I have, imagine the delightful sensation of feeling well again, after nine years of unbroken sickness I am as strong and as well as I was when I was first married."</p>
